{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1000_011ami", "source_sha256": "1b4afdd816e661fbbde68a4dff85606081b85fd5fb93510ecd1d013cb15ce19b", "ja": "天知る、地知る、なめこ汁……。", "zh": "天知、地知、芦笋汁……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1001_p", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1002_011ami", "source_sha256": "a88af756daf363c15cd1854a5b7b3b331573a7209f69a86b206408dd0d31156a", "ja": "美少女探偵アミ＆マミ、華麗にアミだけ参上！　とう！\nくんくん、事件のにおいを兄ちゃんから検出！", "zh": "美少女侦探亚美＆真美，只有亚美华丽登场！喝！\n嗅嗅，从大哥哥身上检测到事件的味道！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9656b9d77e714d51432f03c5d30e13eea0de0f0e7525e451edcff3aa1a8e73d8", "ja": "うわっ、亜美！？　急にどうした！？", "zh": "哇！亚美！？你怎么突然这么说！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1004_011ami", "source_sha256": "119c91d94ad209faca58f5d0d48dc61d3577ce27352f87ac9fdf71d640aedc61", "ja": "ほら、今度真美と美少女探偵の役をすることに\nなったっしょ？　そんでね～。", "zh": "就是啊，下次亚美不是要和真美一起\n扮演美少女侦探吗？所以～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1005_011ami", "source_sha256": "31ab729e34ddd81639a1902ff75c9d509e8a18ad9c6990cd9f4b35686c92319d", "ja": "劇場のみんなに何か困ったことがないか聞いて、\n名探偵亜美がズバリ解決！　って遊びしてるんだー！", "zh": "先在剧场里打听有没有人需要帮忙，再由名侦探亚美\n俐落解决！这就是亚美在玩的游戏喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1006_p", "source_sha256": "279cb3a3caf064aeff96035e3d01cf8c93a1e15ec040ea33e72e5c82183f6cff", "ja": "なるほど、そういうことか。でもどうせなら\n遊びじゃなくて、真面目に役作りを……。", "zh": "原来如此，是这么一回事啊。\n不过，既然要扮侦探就认真融入角色吧，别光顾着玩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1007_011ami", "source_sha256": "e0c08eac8378b615e5bf99f9e2e3f430e25aa264e3d03318b29fd170cc36a375", "ja": "心配ゴム用だよ！　ほらネコとかはー、\n遊びで狩りを覚えるっぽいし。だから遊ばないと！", "zh": "不用担心！猫咪跟其他动物不也是在玩乐中\n学会怎么狩猎吗？所以还是得玩才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1008_011ami", "source_sha256": "579b6bf4fe13ec2b45d40a95d5d7edcff483364143f44d6c7044bf2b6f0ffea5", "ja": "ってことで、ねえ、兄ちゃんの身の回りで何か\n大事件おきてないー？　100兆円事件とか！", "zh": "所以说呢，大哥哥，你身边有发生什么大事件吗～？\n像是100兆日圆事件之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b7bcaf6fe079ec7040f5af43e1f12c300b2fe8889809587d8ae66fed749d0093", "ja": "なんで国家予算規模なんだ……。\nそんな事件おきてるわけないだろ。あ、でも……。", "zh": "规模怎么跟国家预算一样大……\n我身边不可能发生那么大的事件啦。啊，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3a51a78fc770595740247040d32204222d539a6fa4c6d6420cbb4def78770773", "ja": "そういえば、劇場に買い置きしてあったお菓子の\n減りが早い気がしたかな？", "zh": "我想起来了，我买来放在剧场的点心，\n好像减少得很快？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1011_011ami", "source_sha256": "2146b8b16a62b64ecc131034f7c98d8b4a9396fde28df794a3b9d0528d153b26", "ja": "おおっ、いいね～。この美少女探偵アミ＆マミの\n亜美ちゃんが、ズバリ解決だよー！", "zh": "喔喔！不错呢～就交给美少女侦探亚美＆真美的\n亚美来俐落解决吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1012_011ami", "source_sha256": "a7ace9c337f56f2a68f6058786d8752985ee8bbc5600eb56d32130c294649dcd", "ja": "真実はいつも、兄ちゃんの名にかけて！\nむむ～……。ぱーん！", "zh": "真相永远，赌上大哥哥的名誉！\n唔唔～砰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1013_011ami", "source_sha256": "306723bb4c9431e3e32a2ee931bc4e59f31a6b88648ffdedca8d4f91616a1b9f", "ja": "犯人はお前だー！！", "zh": "凶手就是你──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1014_p", "source_sha256": "396c127abf87bd0ffdb13f367a604381757336eec5f39a1373a6e7543928613e", "ja": "ええっ！　俺だったのか！？", "zh": "什么！？是我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1015_011ami", "source_sha256": "fe51bd04b6982aaaf6d989b0529180e6da5f9a60ef2fb3f04af39d7770d71680", "ja": "ううん、違うよ。兄ちゃんの後ろにいる、\nユーレイさんだよ？", "zh": "不对，你误会了。\n是大哥哥背后的那位幽灵喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1016_p", "source_sha256": "cf784dc8488275797d57732539b88ede2514867c53e9f09c9da31fe5111a0ae5", "ja": "は？", "zh": "啥？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1017_011ami", "source_sha256": "176077bf4b66d8f3a27db5cccd0a1c173f865b0b129794147a8acbefccf4b06c", "ja": "この劇場にとりついてる、食いしん坊ユーレイさん。\nユーレイさんの仕業なら、仕方ないね……。", "zh": "它是住在这座剧场里的贪吃幽灵。\n既然是幽灵做的好事，那就无可奈何啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1018_p", "source_sha256": "835e4a1d08047c9e0b87592b11f3e02aa441f0bf922732879419ba73ade13d0f", "ja": "そ、そうか……。そのユーレイさん、\n何か言ってるか？", "zh": "这、这样啊……\n那位幽灵还有说什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1019_011ami", "source_sha256": "aa4814b2d4111f06ed9ae7d855dbed6699fdd06ce1b0b8786539dda9a8c128c4", "ja": "んーとね。……こないだ食べた新作のチョコパイは\nおいしかった！　次は和菓子もいいな～、だって。", "zh": "这个嘛……它说之前吃到的新产品巧克力派很好吃！\n还说下次想吃日式点心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1020_011ami", "source_sha256": "4e2df9885c41f5d0af88afe80cd8e02a039295ef32fbea2340d00d2e4325b449", "ja": "あと、昨日のプリンはめーっちゃ気に入ったから、\n帰りに真美と買って帰っちゃった！　……だって♪", "zh": "还有，昨天的布丁也超～好吃的，\n所以回家路上和真美一起买回去吃了……它是这么说的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1021_p", "source_sha256": "615f195ef9de2d41b6a1c866c20f5d78789d33d246977574dc7d886cd737c343", "ja": "……食べたの、亜美なんだな？", "zh": "……那些都是亚美吃的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1022_011ami", "source_sha256": "d4ae07c987beebcc92a0c16f969eebc650db8e2064debb399d6e4e325ca59e85", "ja": "さあ、事件はユーレイさんのシワザってことで、\nズバリ解決！　ムザイ方面！　いやよかったよかった♪", "zh": "好啦，这个事件的犯人就是幽灵，\n俐落解决！无罪致胖！真是可喜可贺、可喜可贺啊♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1023_011ami", "source_sha256": "d6a1ec3ddb8446f985a66056334f071a5230b4facca8924c98c518c186e9afeb", "ja": "亜美は次の現場に行かなきゃだから、コレにて失礼！\n美少女探偵アミ＆マミ、また来週～～！", "zh": "亚美要赶去下一个事件现场了，告辞！\n美少女侦探亚美＆真美，下周再见～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_011ami0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_011ami0093_1024_p", "source_sha256": "53da6125931d63085f13b332775a4043472ceb540bbb0d459b5194103c30d55c", "ja": "こら待て、亜美ーー！！", "zh": "给我站住，亚美──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
